{"reviews":[{"id":"B01GLTUKKS-0","r":2.0,"t":"Very strong hold, but rough on the hair!","x":"I always buy and use Krieger's regular soft gel bottle and I bought this not knowing that it was a &#34;hard hold gel&#34; and simply thought it was the same soft gel in an easier-to-squeeze container. My fault of course for not reading thoroughly. I went ahead and decided to give it a couple tries instead of returning this product. This product is a really good &#34;hard hold gel.&#34; I even went swimming and brushed my head a few times and for the most part, my hair style stayed the same. The","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B01GLTUKKS-1","r":5.0,"t":"but it easily washes out in the morning","x":"I have short hair and basically do most of the style job with my hands. I have bought Short Sexy Hair for years, and the first time that I used this I was a little worried as it has a bit thicker consistency. After a few times, I got used to the fact that you only need a SMALL amount of this, and it works the same. It is a max hold gel that will basically keep your hair the same overnight, but it easily washes out in the morning. A little more expensive now than the last time I got it, but it's ","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01GLTUKKS-2","r":5.0,"t":"Sexy and spiky hair","x":"Bought this for my husband.  He wanted something that would hold better all day for short hair.  At first, he thought it was too stiff, but now, he loves it.  He went swimming, and his hair was still sexy and spiky.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B01GLTUKKS-3","r":3.0,"t":"Product has changed from \"Styling Gel\" (which we like) to Hard Hold Gel (which we don't like as much.","x":"We wanted to get a bottle of Styling Gel that we ordered last time, but you have changed your product to Hard Hold Gel.  We like the first one we had better.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B01GLTUKKS-4","r":1.0,"t":"White flakes in my hair","x":"I wore this gel when I was at the club.  A girl put her fingers through my hair and it flaked! How embarrassing.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2017"},{"id":"B01GLTUKKS-5","r":5.0,"t":"Fantastic gel!","x":"Fantastic gel!! Goes on thick and holds GREAT! Even in the high winds of Texas! I highly recommend this gel!!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B01GLTUKKS-6","r":4.0,"t":"Hair of steel.","x":"They weren't joking around when they described this as &#34;Hard Hold&#34;. I'm pretty sure that I can deflect bullets with my hair now. Smells much better than most of the products I've tried. Only negative is its blueness... If I happen to miss a clump while styling it looks like a Smurf left something in my hair...","h":2,"v":0,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B01GLTUKKS-7","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome hold and no flakes!","x":"Just like the other reviews, no flake and GREAT hold, and a little bit is all you need.  I squeeze some on my finger tip then mix with water to dilute it and get it on my other finger tips, then I run my fingers through my hair for great shaping/minor spiking.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B01GLTUKKS-8","r":5.0,"t":"Probably one of the best hair gel's I've tried in a while","x":"This stuff is awesome, adds volume and quite strong hold. Doesn't really get crunchy, pretty great. Don't need too much either.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B01GLTUKKS-9","r":5.0,"t":"Great product 1/2 the cost of alternatives at the salon.","x":"Great product.  It is 1/2 the cost of an alternative brand that my salon uses.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B01GLTUKKS-10","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Good product, love it.  my 2nd order, will definitely shop again here.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B01GLTUKKS-11","r":5.0,"t":"Less \"plastic,\" good hold!","x":"Bought this through a discount club that asks for a review in exchange. My husband uses gel for his hair and usually buys the cheap stuff. After trying this, he said he was very happy with it. He uses gel simply to keep his thick hair under control, not to do any crazy/wild/difficult hairdos. It gives a strong hold without the &#34;crunchy, plastic-y&#34; (his words) feel. From my perspective, his hair had less of that &#34;shine&#34; that you get from gel, so it looked more natural. I combed my","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B01GLTUKKS-12","r":5.0,"t":"Strong Hold It is!","x":"I know it says for me but Im using it for my pixie cut hair that's starting to grow. :D It smells good and holds the style that I want. I normally use it to keep my bangs side swept and it does the job! Makes it easier for me to style my hair! As of type of hair, I have a thick asian hair, kinda wavy. And this gel holds my hair pretty good. For my whole 12 hr shift,  I don't need to worry bout my bangs falling on my forehead. Received this item with a discount for my unbias personal feedback.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B01GLTUKKS-13","r":5.0,"t":"MOM ROCKS!!","x":"My 8 and 9 year old boys are very concerned about how their hair looks before they walk out the door on their way to school. So I purchased this product hoping it would help them a little more than the others we have tried, leaving their hair hard, wet looking and stuff. Well, this IS THE ONE!! This gel is perfect for wet or dry hair! Just a dime size in your palm rub your hands together, swipe it through my boys hair, and BAM! Mom rules! YAY! Thank you Krieger+Sohne.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01GLTUKKS-14","r":5.0,"t":"great hold and shine","x":"I have been using this since the day I received it and have to say i've been totally happy.  Takes only a small amount so will last a long time.  The hold is fantastic without leaving any flakes and very easy to brush out.  Goes on blue but dries clear.  Smells nice and does not dry out your hair.  Can be used on any hair style as my hair is long and I love this stuff.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B01GLTUKKS-15","r":5.0,"t":"Please bring it back","x":"I love this gel so much. Not sure why they stopped making it. I would gladly buy it again for double the price. If you know where to get this stuff, PLEASE let me know.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B01GLTUKKS-16","r":5.0,"t":"Just a little dab...","x":"Just a pea-sized amount is all it takes to make my son's fine hair stand straight up for his Mohawk, and it lasts all day! Great product!","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B01GLTUKKS-17","r":5.0,"t":"This is a great product! My teenage son has difficult hair and ...","x":"This is a great product! My teenage son has difficult hair and this seems to really hold his hair in place.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2018"},{"id":"B01GLTUKKS-18","r":4.0,"t":"... than normally use and it really did not do better than the cheaper that is use","x":"More expensive than normally use and it really did not do better than the cheaper that is use.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01GLTUKKS-19","r":5.0,"t":"Super strong","x":"My husband love it. Super super strong. Extra hold like i nerver seen before","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B01GLTUKKS-20","r":5.0,"t":"Great for cowlick hair. Stays put!","x":"Fabulous.....this is the only stuff that holds my husband's wiry hair down.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B01GLTUKKS-21","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"This gel is Awesome!!! Love how it holds my hair in place!!!\ud83d\udc4d\ud83d\udc4d\ud83d\udc4d","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B01GLTUKKS-22","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"This gel is Awesome!!! Love how it holds my hair in place!!!\ud83d\udc4d\ud83d\udc4d\ud83d\udc4d","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B01GLTUKKS-23","r":5.0,"t":"My husband loves this!","x":"Bought this as a stocking gift for my guy. He is hooked!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B01GLTUKKS-24","r":5.0,"t":"My husband loves this!","x":"Bought this as a stocking gift for my guy. He is hooked!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the strong, long-lasting hold, including through wind and swimming.","cites":[1,3,6,7,8,9,12,13,15]},{"text":"Many note that only a small amount is needed, making the product last a long time.","cites":[2,8,9,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers report no flaking and easy washing or brushing out, though one experienced embarrassing white flakes.","cites":[2,5,8,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers mention the gel's blue color, which dries clear but can look odd if missed while styling.","cites":[7,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers dislike the switch to a hard-hold formula, finding it too stiff or rough compared to the previous softer gel.","cites":[1,3,4]}]},"qa":[]}